            "description": "\nThe endpoint `/v1/airline/reservation` is a POST request that is used to make a reservation with an airline. The request should include a payload with the following structure:\n```json\n{\n    \"ref_id\":\"\",\n    \"passengers\":[\n        {\n            \"title\":\"\",\n            \"first_name\":\"\",\n            \"last_name\":\"\",\n            \"gender\":\"\",\n            \"dob\":\"\",\n            \"nationality\":\"\",\n            \"nic\":\"\",\n            \"passport_number\":\"\",\n            \"passport_expiry\":\"\",\n            \"passport_country\":\"\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"contact_info\":{\n        \"first_name\":\"\",\n        \"last_name\":\"\",\n        \"email_address\":\"\",\n        \"phone_number_country\":\"\",\n        \"phone_number\":\"\"\n    }\n}\n```\nThe response to this request returned a status code of 500 and a content type of `text/html`. The response body was a HTML document containing debugging information, which included dynamic properties such as PNR and validTill.\n\nHere is a JSON schema representing the response:\n```json\n{\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"PNR\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The reservation's PNR\"\n        },\n        \"validTill\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The date and time until which the reservation is valid\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n"
